NAME
     bc - a calculator

SYNOPSIS
     bc [-l] [FILE...]

DESCRIPTION
     bc reads expressions and prints their values, with arbitrary-length
     integers and a scale for fractions. It has variables, arrays,
     functions, if, while and for, and the usual operators including ^
     for powers and % for the remainder. scale, length, sqrt and the
     other built-ins are here; -l adds the mathematical library (s, c,
     a, l, e, j).

OPTIONS
     -l   the mathematical library, and scale 20

SEE ALSO
     expr(1), awk(1)
